WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:04.212
Meet the smallest monkey in the world,

00:00:04.212 --> 00:00:06.589
the pygmy marmoset.

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:09.050
An adult will fit in the palm of your hand.

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:11.970
Being so tiny makes it hard to know who's friend,

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:13.346
foe,

00:00:14.305 --> 00:00:15.348
or food.

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:20.311
There's a whole wide world,

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:23.189
living beneath our feet.

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:25.233
Don't believe me?

00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:26.234
Look closer.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.990
In a land of giants...

00:00:34.659 --> 00:00:36.661
...it's the smallest creatures...

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:39.914
...that make the biggest difference.

00:00:42.959 --> 00:00:45.628
A midwife toad on a dangerous mission.

00:00:46.254 --> 00:00:48.923
His precious eggs need to get to water fast.

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:51.259
And he'll risk his life to do it.

00:01:00.185 --> 00:01:01.853
Join me, Paul Rudd,

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:05.482
as we experience tiny wonders

00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:08.067
like you've never seen before.

